                Revenue growth is limited by client bandwidth. Leads get delivered, but administrative teams get overwhelmed, creating a ceiling for your agency's scale.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start">
