                <img alt="Strong marketing lead flow narrowing through overloaded client operations and resulting in delayed conversion and revenue leakage" class="h-auto w-full" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/static/images/agency-revenue-bottleneck.avif">
            </figure>

            <div class="space-y-4">
                <article class="trust-card-accent group">
                    <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div class="icon-tile mb-0 bg-error/10 group-hover:bg-error/20">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-error">trending_down</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-accent">Dropped Revenue</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Slow intake teams fail to follow up on the high-quality leads you provide.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="trust-card-accent group">
                    <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div class="icon-tile mb-0 bg-error/10 group-hover:bg-error/20">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-error">timer</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-accent">Wasted Hours</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Skilled professionals spend valuable time on manual paperwork and entry-level tasks.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="trust-card-accent group">
                    <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div class="icon-tile mb-0 bg-error/10 group-hover:bg-error/20">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-error">sync_disabled</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-accent">Contract Churn</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Back-office bottlenecks lead to paused marketing spend when clients cannot handle the growth.</p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

